  "description": "26\" Electric Beach Cruiser with 350W Motor & Shimano 7-Speed\nThe Micargi Luna is a beach cruiser electric bike that packs a 350W front hub motor and 48V Samsung Lithium Ion battery. The Luna is perfect for those who love Micargi beach cruisers but are looking for extra pedaling power. With a speed sensor, The Micargi Luna provides just that: 5 modes of pedal assist and throttle when a little extra power is needed. Equipped with Shimano Tourney 7 Speed and a motor, there are no limitations on where to go. On a full charge, the battery will last about 4-6 hours and about 35 miles depending on what mode is being ridden on. The top speed of the Micargi Luna is 23 miles per hour.\nSpecifications:",
